OL,3,AMarooned Lord Byron statue returns to
OL,4,AHyde Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statue of the 19th-century poet Lord
OL,7,FByron has been returned to Hyde Park,
OL,8,Fnearly 70 years after it was isolated
OL,9,Fon a traffic island when new roads were
OL,10,Fbuilt through the area in the early
OL,11,F1960s.
OL,13,FThe Grade II-listed statue was erected
OL,14,Fas a national memorial in 1880 after
OL,15,Freceiving special permission from Queen
OL,16,FVictoria. Changes to the Park Lane road
OL,17,Flayout 80 years later left it
OL,18,Finaccessible, leading it to become
OL,19,Fisolated, neglected and dirty.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
