OL,3,AMarooned Lord Byron statue returns to
OL,4,AHyde Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lord Byron Society launched a
OL,7,Fcampaign to relocate the statue six
OL,8,Fyears ago, arguing it had become
OL,9,Fneglected.
OL,11,FThe move cost more than #400,000,
OL,12,Ffunded by a #230,000 grant from The
OL,13,FNational Lottery Heritage Fund and
OL,14,Fadditional donations.
